{
  "key": 32458,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_ThisIsWhereSpiritsRest",
      "en_US": [
        "This is where spirits rest.\n",
        "Please be quiet and respectful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_ThisIsTheLostTower",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Lost Tower.\r",
        "There is a persistent fog that thickens\n",
        "the higher you climb.\r",
        "If you can’t use the hidden move Defog\n",
        "and you have no business here, there\f",
        "is no need to go up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignScientistFGives",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hello!\n",
        "Welcome to the Lost Tower.\r",
        "Are you interested in hearing about\n",
        "Ghost-type Pokémon?\r",
        "There’s an old folk tale about a\n",
        "nefarious Ghost-type Pokémon that\f",
        "could travel across time.\r",
        "This cloth is said to be a memoir\n",
        "of that Pokémon.\r",
        "As thanks for listening,\n",
        "I’d like to make it a gift to you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignScientistFExplains",
      "en_US": [
        "Ghost-types can be strong allies like\n",
        "any other type of Pokémon.\r",
        "But there’s always a sinister feeling\n",
        "about them, wouldn’t you agree?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignScientistFAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Ghost-types can be strong allies like\n",
        "any other type of Pokémon.\r",
        "But there’s always a sinister feeling\n",
        "about them, wouldn’t you agree?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Ghost-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Ghost-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be a {COLOR 1}Ghost-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Ghost-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Ghost-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for a Ghost-type battle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Ghost-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Ghost-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Ghost-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Ghost-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209LostTower1F_Text_SovereignGhostMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
